 .../nemo-qml-plugin-notifications/default.nix | 117 +++++++++++++
 overlay/asteroidos/timed-qt6/default.nix      | 163 +++++++++++++++++-
 10 files changed, 583 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 overlay/asteroidos/nemo-qml-plugin-alarms/default.nix
 create mode 100644 overlay/asteroidos/nemo-qml-plugin-notifications/default.nix

